<div class="about-container">
	<title>10 Minute Files - About</title>
    <div class="section">
        <h2 class="title">Support the Project</h2>
        <p class="description">
            I run 10 Minute Files out of my own pocket because I believe that the internet was at its
            best when it was built by real people making useful things. As the modern web has grown
            more corporatized and hostile, small projects like this can still cut through the haze
            and remind us what the internet used to represent.
            <br><br>
            We don't want your data, but if you do appreciate what we do and what we stand for, a
            small donation toward server costs helps keep the lights on. Completely optional, but
            always appreciated. Thank you for using the service and supporting independent projects.
            <br><br>
            - Vy
        </p>
    </div>

